  <ul>
    <li><a href="/docs/how-it-works">How it works</a>: the core, the ports, ownership and durability.</li>
    <li><a href={repoDoc("browser-host.md")}>Running in a browser</a>: the four topologies, from one worker to shards shared by tabs.</li>
    <li><a href={repoDoc("gaps.md")}>Gaps</a>: what cellb does not do yet.</li>
  </ul>
</Docs>
